        "message": "Validate the LSTM softmax child runtime type during deserialization (#4670)\n\nNetwork::CreateFromFile can return a network subclass other than\nFullyConnected. Verify the runtime type before storing the child, delete\nrejected networks, and leave softmax_ null on failure.\n\nAdd tests for rejected Input children and valid FullyConnected children\nacross both softmax LSTM variants.\n\nAssisted-by: AI tooling (static audit and test drafting)\nSigned-off-by: Nathan Keys <professor.moody@pm.me>",
        "tree": {
