        "message": "Fix exit code when no renderers could be created (#4669)\n\nWhen renderer initialization fails for every requested output format\n(e.g. the output file cannot be created), PreloadRenderers leaves the\nrenderer vector empty and main1() falls through with ret_val set to\nEXIT_SUCCESS, so tesseract exits 0 after printing an error. Scripts\ncalling the CLI cannot detect the failure without parsing stderr.\n\nSet EXIT_FAILURE when outputbase was requested but no renderers could\nbe created. Plain text output and stdout mode are unaffected because\nthey always produce a renderer; training mode pushes a null renderer.\n\nFixes #4668",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "fec1f66c0247f5c9a7148262bc323443389fb48d",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tesseract-ocr/tesseract/git/trees/fec1f66c0247f5c9a7148262bc323443389fb48d"
        },
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tesseract-ocr/tesseract/git/commits/4d8565029174d6d70385795eebefd876533e9b97",
        "comment_count": 0,
        "verification": {
